1
00:00:03,040 --> 00:00:10,961
Listen, this isn’t about charts or candles,

2
00:00:11,001 --> 00:00:18,281
It’s about you, about the path that heals inside.

3
00:00:18,321 --> 00:00:21,922
You weren’t born with a “buy” button,

4
00:00:21,942 --> 00:00:29,362
The terminal in swaddles couldn’t open for you.

5
00:00:29,382 --> 00:00:33,103
There was a call to become more than you are,

6
00:00:33,123 --> 00:00:37,163
It whispered in candles, in shorts, in every test.

7
00:00:37,223 --> 00:00:40,823
You thought freedom was here, suddenly,

8
00:00:40,843 --> 00:00:44,524
But the market is a mirror, a test for your ears.

9
00:00:44,544 --> 00:00:47,324
Cycles, schemes, dumps, pullbacks,

10
00:00:47,344 --> 00:00:51,624
In the loop you lost yourself - brother, know these dates.

11
00:00:51,644 --> 00:00:55,765
Not a trader, not a player - but alive,

12
00:00:55,785 --> 00:01:01,645
Between the entry points, an empty heart inside.

13
00:01:01,665 --> 00:01:08,126
Not advice, but a cry, not tables, but dreams,

14
00:01:08,246 --> 00:01:16,446
Stay on the path - something will awaken within.

15
00:01:16,466 --> 00:01:35,828
Trading isn’t a profession, it’s a ritual,

16
00:01:35,868 --> 00:01:39,128
Go through hell, hear the silence - that’s the signal.

17
00:01:39,148 --> 00:01:41,188
No instructions, only revelation,

18
00:01:41,248 --> 00:01:45,189
Pain and drawdowns - your understanding, your vision.

19
00:01:45,329 --> 00:01:47,249
You can leave, but stay with me,

20
00:01:47,369 --> 00:01:50,569
Inside lives the unbreakable, sacred, steadfast.

21
00:01:50,589 --> 00:01:53,449
Not a trader, not a player - but alive,

22
00:01:53,469 --> 00:02:00,990
Between the entry points, an empty heart inside.

23
00:02:01,010 --> 00:02:07,210
Not advice, but a cry, not tables, but dreams,

24
00:02:07,230 --> 00:02:15,611
Stay on the path - something will awaken within.

25
00:02:15,771 --> 00:02:35,553
You entered the game, but don’t lose yourself,

26
00:02:35,693 --> 00:02:38,553
Look deep within, ignite your own light.

27
00:02:38,573 --> 00:02:41,653
Every drawdown, every entry point - a lesson,

28
00:02:41,733 --> 00:02:45,794
Every short and long - a step to your living mind, brother.

29
00:02:45,974 --> 00:02:48,854
No signals - there’s only you,

30
00:02:49,014 --> 00:02:52,274
No freedom in the market, but there is an inner temple.

31
00:02:52,334 --> 00:02:55,954
Wake up… hear yourself between the lines,

32
00:02:55,994 --> 00:02:59,175
In every market noise, your voice, your current.

33
00:02:59,235 --> 00:03:01,575
This isn’t a text, it’s a ritual,

34
00:03:01,595 --> 00:03:04,115
Chronicle of life, inner path - the finale.

35
00:03:04,215 --> 00:03:08,535
Welcome to the path, here is all yours,

36
00:03:08,595 --> 00:03:11,156
No signals - only the living.

